\code{verified_user}, and integer \code{input_rows}, \code{user_rows}, \code{latest_user_rows},
\code{verified_rows}, and \code{overrides_applied}. \code{diagnostics} is a tibble with
integer \code{stage}, character \code{operation}, logical \code{completed}, and double
